1
00:00:10,199 --> 00:00:12,800
She presses cardboard to her skin.

2
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,800
No space between her belly and mine.

3
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,800
I hesitate, the coaster falls,

4
00:00:24,199 --> 00:00:27,199
And crosses out our last thin line.

5
00:00:28,199 --> 00:00:32,200
Her heavy sigh hits like an axe,

6
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,200
It cuts right through my frozen fear.

7
00:00:38,799 --> 00:00:42,200
I bite my lip until it bleeds,

8
00:00:43,799 --> 00:00:46,799
And choose to fight while she is here.

9
00:00:48,799 --> 00:00:51,799
I slam my center against hers.

10
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:56,200
My iron grip takes full command.

11
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,200
The formulas are dead and gone,

12
00:01:02,799 --> 00:01:05,799
As we fly wildly hand in hand.

13
00:01:06,799 --> 00:01:10,799
Ginger lays her hand upon my chest,

14
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,200
To feel the storm that roars inside.

15
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:20,200
She whispers 'lion' in my ear,

16
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:25,200
With nowhere left for me to hide.

17
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:10,199
The scared beginner dies tonight.

18
00:02:12,199 --> 00:02:15,199
The quickstep burns across the floor.

19
00:02:17,199 --> 00:02:20,199
No rules, no fear, no hesitation,

20
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:25,199
I am a timid boy no more.

21
00:02:26,199 --> 00:02:29,199
I lie in bed, my muscles glow.

22
00:02:31,199 --> 00:02:34,199
Her jasmine lingers in the dark.

23
00:02:36,199 --> 00:02:39,199
The cold machine is dead and gone...

24
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:46,199
I start to wear the lion's mark.